# SHOJI — Paper & Ink — hand-authored dual-scheme palette.
# Ptyxis picks the section by the system colour scheme; the theme sets light,
# so [Light] is the real design and [Dark] is its sumi-night companion for
# anyone who flips GNOME to dark without switching themes.

